SUMMARY:BASICS OF TAI CHI
DESCRIPTION:Raleigh & Triangle Activities Meetup Group\nRegistration: [www
 .unityholisticwellnesscenter.org/workshops](https://www.unityholistiwellne
 sscenter.org)\nFee: $35 per person\n\n***Gain a Deeper Understanding of th
 e Internal Aspects of Tai Chi***\nJoin us for a very special event\, a **v
 irtual workshop** with *Kevin Werre of Awareness Tai Ch*i in Alberta\, Can
 ada. Kevin began learning tai chi of the Moy Lin Shin style at age 24\, an
 d he became an instructor soon after. Teaching Mr. Moy’s Tai Chi and int
 ernal arts for four decades\, Kevin emphasizes not just physical movements
  but also an awareness of the energetic and meditative aspects of the prac
 tice.\n*This workshop is intended for current and past students of Moy Lin
  Shin style Tai Chi*. Participants will be on zoom with Kevin\, so he will
  be able to see us all and personalize the workshop to our needs. There is
  no credit if you register\, but do not attend. A recording will be availa
 ble for all that register.
